            "review_text": "NhungNguyen\nPhu Quoc Island, Vietnam13 contributions\n0\nAmazing taste, friendly staff\nMay 2019 • Couples\nI came here as recommendation of my friend, she is local people in Da Nang city, she only has snail here in Da Nang\nThe store is small, not too many table, staffs were super friendly and honestly\nMenu with photos and design of menu look professional\nFood was served very fast\nThe way the waiter put the dishes on our table looks very well trained\nFood is excellent\nI gonna come back\nRead more\nWritten May 12, 2019",
