            "review_title": "Review at Oc Ken Restaurant",
            "review_text": "emmatrevv7\nCanada7 contributions\n0\nIncredible seafood!!\nDec 2017\nMy partner and I found this place after having no luck finding an English menu anywhere. This was the first place we found that had an english menu so we thought we would give it a shot! We’re so happy we did. All the staff warmly greet you and give you service with a smile. Even with a massive language barrier, they were very patient trying to understand when they clearly aren’t used to serving westerners. I can’t express enough how delicious the seafood was! Definitely the best seafood we have come across in Southeast Asia. So fresh and so many options to pick from. I had a noodle dish with mixed seafood and my partner had a spicy squid dish. Both incredible and when we came back the next night, it was just as delicious and they even gave us a complimentary plate of French fries! Such a hidden gem and if you’re ok to sacrifice the language barrier a bit to get a true taste of local cuisine in Da Nang, this is the right place!\nRead more\nWritten December 14, 2017",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-04",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
